  "changes": [
    "WeaponMagazine composes real AbilitySystem.TryActivate/Tick, AbilityDefinition.WithCooldown/AddCost/BlockedBy and GameplayTagSet; ammo costs, fire cooldown and reload gating are framework-owned.",
    "FpsPlayer removes nextShot/Time.time fire gating and advances owned ability state through EntityLogic elapsed time. Real hitscan passes shooter Framework Entity.Id.",
    "TargetPractice uses UnitModel.ConfigureHealth/TakeDamage/OnDamaged/OnDied for health, clamping, attacker identity and death dispatch. EntityManager/TimerManager still own hide/pool and respawn scheduling.",
    "Target lifecycle unsubscribes prior UnitModel handlers and cancels an old respawn timer when the pooled instance is shown again with another entity ID."
  ],
